     "content": "{\"tickets\":[{\"level\":\"clear_a\",\"text\":\"Could you send me a downloadable file of the information associated with my account, including my profile details and activity history? I\u2019m organizing my records.\"},{\"level\":\"clear_a\",\"text\":\"I\u2019d like to receive a copy of the information you keep on my account, preferably in a format I can save. Please let me know how to get it.\"},{\"level\":\"lean_a\",\"text\":\"After seeing my searches influence the recommendations I get, I\u2019m uneasy about what\u2019s retained. Could you send me a copy of the information linked to my account?\"},{\"level\":\"lean_a\",\"text\":\"I don\u2019t love that my location seems to affect the offers I see, but first I\u2019d like a downloadable copy of the details and activity you have associated with me.\"},{\"level\":\"even\",\"text\":\"I noticed the recommendations seem connected to things I\u2019ve looked at. Can you tell me what information you have about me and how it factors into those suggestions?\"},{\"level\":\"even\",\"text\":\"An old address of mine appeared in a recent interaction, which caught me off guard. I\u2019d like to understand what details of mine are on file and what they\u2019re being used for.\"},{\"level\":\"lean_b\",\"text\":\"It\u2019s unsettling that an ad seemed to reflect something I only discussed near my phone. Could you show me which account details or activity might have shaped it?\"},{\"level\":\"lean_b\",\"text\":\"I never expected my browsing to affect the offers I receive, and I\u2019m uncomfortable with that. Please show me the profile categories you\u2019ve linked to my account so I can understand what\u2019s driving it.\"},{\"level\":\"clear_b\",\"text\":\"Why are you using my purchase history to target me with ads? It feels invasive, and I want that practice stopped.\"},{\"level\":\"clear_b\",\"text\":\"I turned off personalized recommendations, but the app still seems to use my activity to tailor what I see. This is frustrating and makes me question how my information is being handled.\"}]}",
